---
description: Prepare one advanceConsequences evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: CharacterAction[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Apply actions through the exact world simulator, then interpret their social and narrative consequences without rewriting physical outcomes. Preserve causal history, update beliefs only through information channels, and record unresolved story obligations for later sessions. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
